§ `The Schedule: exempt broadcasting services`

-- src:3 | First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 16th September 2010 at 5:00 pm.
-- src:110 | THE SCHEDULE
-- src:111 | Paragraph 2
-- src:112 | EXEMPT BROADCASTING SERVICES
-- src:114 | 1. Special interest television services transmitted through an educational
-- src:115 | institution’s closed Internet protocol network.
-- src:117 | 2. Special interest radio services transmitted through an educational
-- src:118 | institution’s closed Internet protocol network.
-- src:120 | 3. Special interest radio services transmitted through an educational institu-
-- src:121 | tion’s public address system.
@ref S 523/2010 publication line and the Schedule (items 1 to 3) (src:3-121)
-- Paragraph 2: "exempt broadcasting service" means a licensable broadcasting service specified in the Schedule. Item 1 special interest television services transmitted through an educational institution's closed Internet protocol network;
-- item 2 special interest radio services transmitted through such a network; item 3 special interest radio services transmitted through an educational institution's public address system.
GIVEN `it is a special interest television service transmitted through an educational institution's closed Internet protocol network` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a special interest radio service transmitted through an educational institution's closed Internet protocol network` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a special interest radio service transmitted through an educational institution's public address system` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 523/2010 Schedule the service is an exempt broadcasting service` MEANS
    `it is a special interest television service transmitted through an educational institution's closed Internet protocol network` OR `it is a special interest radio service transmitted through an educational institution's closed Internet protocol network` OR `it is a special interest radio service transmitted through an educational institution's public address system`
